WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:03.049
(ethereal music)

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:06.734
(water splashing)

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:07.627
- [Julien] When you enter a cenote

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:10.508
it's really like going into another world.

00:00:10.508 --> 00:00:13.091
Like leaving the planet behind.

00:00:14.684 --> 00:00:18.817
This is a feeling of really
exploring something new.

00:00:18.817 --> 00:00:22.095
And I feel very lucky
to be able to see that.

00:00:22.095 --> 00:00:24.999
(ethereal music)

00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:27.749
(water bubbling)

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:32.351
My name is Julien Borde.

00:00:32.351 --> 00:00:34.339
I've been free diving and scuba diving

00:00:34.339 --> 00:00:36.234
for the last 15 years.

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:37.842
Going many different location,

00:00:37.842 --> 00:00:41.576
always trying to find
the best diving spot.

00:00:41.576 --> 00:00:43.236
(water gurgling)

00:00:43.236 --> 00:00:45.319
Though cenotes are caves,

00:00:46.262 --> 00:00:48.926
all the cenotes are
connected to each others.

00:00:48.926 --> 00:00:50.541
And the water goes and flows

00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:54.622
from one cenote to another
cenote to end up in the sea.

00:00:54.622 --> 00:00:57.279
(ethereal music)

00:00:57.279 --> 00:00:59.263
The first time you go into a cenote

00:00:59.263 --> 00:01:01.941
it's something you
don't see anywhere else.

00:01:01.941 --> 00:01:03.849
It's completely different experience

00:01:03.849 --> 00:01:06.512
than diving in the ocean.

00:01:06.512 --> 00:01:09.815
At the beginning it can
be a little bit scary.

00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:10.834
But really quickly,

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:14.711
the beauty of the place
will just take over.

00:01:14.711 --> 00:01:17.461
(chimes ringing)

00:01:18.694 --> 00:01:20.504
Some cenotes are very welcoming,

00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:22.637
sometimes, so big and so clear,

00:01:22.637 --> 00:01:24.467
that it really gives you the sensation

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:26.544
you go into a church and you
don't want to talk too loud

00:01:26.544 --> 00:01:28.377
to not disturb anyone.

00:01:29.511 --> 00:01:31.774
And some of the cenotes
are really so polluted like

00:01:31.774 --> 00:01:33.479
an atmosphere more like hell

00:01:33.479 --> 00:01:36.896
with dead trees on the bottom and sulfur.

00:01:39.348 --> 00:01:41.249
The Mayans were using the cenotes

00:01:41.249 --> 00:01:42.999
for a very long time.

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.194
Basically the land where we are

00:01:45.194 --> 00:01:47.703
that's the place where
the living people lives

00:01:47.703 --> 00:01:49.698
and then underneath the cenotes,

00:01:49.698 --> 00:01:53.281
into the ground was
the place for the dead.

00:01:55.527 --> 00:01:57.714
Every cenote have a different personality,

00:01:57.714 --> 00:02:01.881
but I also think that here you
affect your own personality.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.691
(ethereal music)

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:09.634
At some point you kind of
enter into like a meditation state.

00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:12.946
It is, for me, completely priceless.

00:02:12.946 --> 00:02:15.696
(ethereal music)

